#. module: timesheet_grid
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/timesheet_grid/static/src/js/tours/timesheet_grid.js:0
msgid ""
"<b>Add a description</b> <br/> <i>Briefly summarize your activity, e.g., "
"\"Metting with the customer.\"</i>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Tambahkan deskripsi</b> <br/> <i> Buat rangkuman singkat tentang "
"aktivitas Anda, misalnya, \"Bertemu dengan pelanggan.\"</i>"

#. module: timesheet_grid
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/timesheet_grid/static/src/js/tours/timesheet_grid.js:0
msgid ""
"<b>Add time in the Grid view</b> <br/> <i>Click a cell to enter hours. Press "
"Tab or Enter to navigate easily.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Tambahkan waktu di tampilan Grid</b> <br/> <i> Klik sel untuk memasukkan "
"jam. Tekan Tab atau Enter untuk navigasi praktis.</i>"

#. module: timesheet_grid
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/timesheet_grid/static/src/js/tours/timesheet_grid.js:0
msgid ""
"<b>Create the timesheet</b> <br/> <i>Once saved, the timer automatically "
"restarts for your next activity.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Buat timesheet</b> <br/> <i> Setelah disimpan, timer akan otomatis "
"dimulai ulang untuk aktivitas berikutnya.</i>"

#. module: timesheet_grid
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/timesheet_grid/static/src/js/tours/timesheet_grid.js:0
msgid ""
"<b>Select a project</b> <br/> <i>Choose the relevant project, such as a "
"customer or team project.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Pilih proyek</b> <br/> <i> Pilih proyek yang relevan, seperti proyek "
"pelanggan atau tim.</i>"

#. module: timesheet_grid
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/timesheet_grid/static/src/js/tours/timesheet_grid.js:0
msgid ""
"<b>Start managing your timesheets</b> <br/> <i>Everything you track begins "
"here.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Mulai kelola timesheet Anda</b> <br/> <i> Semua yang harus dilacak "
"dimulai dari sini.</i>"

#. module: timesheet_grid
#: model_terms:digest.tip,tip_description:timesheet_grid.digest_tip_timesheet_grid_0
msgid "<b>Tip: Let the Timesheets Assistant do the hard work</b>"
msgstr ""

#. module: timesheet_grid
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/timesheet_grid/static/src/js/tours/timesheet_grid.js:0
msgid ""
"<b>Use the timer to track your activities</b> <br/> <i>Start the timer, then "
"log a timesheet when your activity ends. It restarts automatically for the "
"next task.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Gunakan timer untuk melacak aktivitas Anda</b> <br/> <i> Mulai timer, "
"lalu catat timesheet saat aktivitas selesai. Timer akan dimulai ulang secara "
"otomatis untuk tugas berikutnya.</i>"

